# Source-class eligibility (ADR-010)

- Persist `observations.source_class` (`portal` | `cadastral` | `registry` | `feed`). Default `portal`.
- Verdict `source_classes` are computed from stored observations, never trusted from the LLM.
- `post_validate_verdicts` must keep the cadastral-alone rule: cadastral evidence cannot corroborate a non-geometry predicate.
- Cadastre = parcel geometry. Conservatória = legal title. Do not merge those claims.
- Do not store NIC as a silent property-level flag that later portal ads inherit. Parcel binding is its own confidence.
